# Local web API. Production / preview builds use https://arsalandev.studio (see eas.json).
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://localhost:3000
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://arsalandev.studio

# Google sign-in (optional).
#
# Mobile opens https://arsalandev.studio/oauth/mobile-google which uses Google Identity
# Services (JS origin only — no OAuth redirect URI / custom scheme on the Web client).
# The page returns an id_token to arsalanstudio://oauthredirect, then the app calls
# POST /api/auth/google.
#
# 1) Google Cloud Console → OAuth consent screen
#    - External + Testing → add YOUR Google account under Test users
#      (AccessBlocked almost always means Testing + email not listed)
# 2) Credentials → OAuth 2.0 Client ID → Web application (same as Auth.js)
#    - Authorized JavaScript origins: https://arsalandev.studio
#    - Authorized redirect URIs: https://arsalandev.studio/api/auth/callback/google
#      (web Auth.js only — do not add arsalanstudio:// schemes on the Web client)
# 3) Copy Client ID → EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID and server AUTH_GOOGLE_ID
#    Use the FULL client id (starts with digits, ends in .apps.googleusercontent.com).
#    A truncated id causes Google’s “404 / OAuth client was not found” page.
# 4) Server must deploy POST /api/auth/google and AUTH_GOOGLE_ID (+ AUTH_GOOGLE_SECRET for web).
#
# Optional native clients (store / Dev Client builds):
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_IOS_CLIENT_ID=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_ANDROID_CLIENT_ID=
# EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_WEB_CLIENT_ID=
